t has no email address, which is required for payment. Please contact support or sign in with an account that has an email.\",\"sdk_failed\":\"The payment service failed to load. Please reload the page and try again.\"},\"buy_credit_modal\":{\"pro_title\":\"You've run out of AI credits!\",\"pro_desc\":\"Don't worry, you can easily top up your credits to continue creating amazing edits.\",\"pro_button\":\"Get credit\",\"pro_rollover\":\"Unused credits roll over as long as you're subscribed\",\"free_title\":\"You've run out of credits!\",\"free_desc\":\"Don't worry, you can unlock SnapEdit PRO to continue creating amazing edits.\",\"free_button\":\"Unlock PRO\"},\"past_due_modal\":{\"title\":\"Subscription On Hold\",\"desc\":\"Your subscription payment is overdue. Please update your payment method to continue using premium features.\",\"update_payment\":\"Update payment\",\"dismiss\":\"Dismiss\"},\"promo_modal\":{\"code_label\":\"Discount code\",\"copy_and_view\":\"Copy code \u0026 view plans\",\"copied\":\"Discount code copied!\",\"dismiss\":\"Maybe later\",\"days\":\"Days\",\"hours\":\"Hrs\",\"minutes\":\"Min\",\"seconds\":\"Sec\"},\"clock_skew_modal\":{\"title\":\"Incorrect device time\",\"desc\":\"Your device's clock appears to be out of sync, which prevents us from verifying your request. Please set your date, time and time zone to automatic and try again.\",\"dismiss\":\"Got it\"},\"app_ads\":{\"title\":\"Get SnapEdit mobile app\",\"subtitle\":\"Download SnapEdit background remover application on iOS and Android\"},\"size\":{\"small\":\"Small\",\"medium\":\"Medium\",\"large\":\"Large\"},\"theme_toggle\":{\"label\":\"Toggle theme\"},\"login\":{\"title\":\"Login to SnapEdit\",\"subtitle\":\"Sign in to access all features and your saved projects.\",\"continue_google\":\"Continue with Google\",\"continue_facebook\":\"Continue with Facebook\",\"continue_apple\":\"Continue with Apple\",\"email_placeholder\":\"Enter your email\",\"continue_email\":\"Continue with Email